    passiveDescription: "<b>Leader of Protectors</b>: Grants <b><color=#15c>+1</color></b>
      <b><color=#900>attack</color></b> to all allies who are <b><color=#555>Protectors</color></b>
      or <b><color=#555>Independent units</color></b>.\n<b>Anti-motion</b>: Grants
      <b><color=#15c>+1</color></b> <b><color=#760>defense</color></b> to all allies
      and  an additional <b><color=#15c>+1</color></b> <b><color=#760>defense</color></b>
      if they're <b><color=#775>guarding</color></b>.\n\U0001F517 <b>Crushing</b>:
      When I <b>attack \U0001F4A5</b> I get <b><color=#15c>+4</color></b> <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>
      <i>(for that attack)</i>.\n\U0001F4AB <b>Protector's insignia</b>: When the
      enemies who are <b><color=#714>\U0001F3F4 mercenaries</color></b> <b>attack
      \U0001F4A5</b> they get <b><color=#15c>-2</color></b> <b><color=#900>attack</color></b>
      <i>(for that attack)</i> when targetting <b><color=#555>Protectors</color></b>
      or <b><color=#555>Independent units</color></b>.\n"
